WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Create, remix and publish without a website account.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open the folder in your coding tool. Run soyli dev.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Build, review your posting, then publish with your Nostr identity.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Open your share link. Play it. Pass it around.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Choose Remix this. Copy the install-and-remix command. Make it yours.
